 1054|  1.08k|                                                                  std::is_nothrow_move_constructible_v<E>) {
 1055|       |    // Both branches below end with one unguarded move. With one nothrow move a
 1056|       |    // rollback is always possible; with two throwing moves the last step could
 1057|       |    // fail after both originals are gone, leaving a destroyed member under a
 1058|       |    // stale discriminant. std::expected::swap has the same
 1059|       |    // requirement.
